WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
Picture two people at a gurdwara.

2
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:04.120
Both arrive early.

3
00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.270
Both join in every hymn.

4
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.390
From the outside, they
look exactly the same.

5
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.740
But is looking the same on
the outside the whole story?

6
00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.950
One Sikh scripture even
speaks of a chronic disease,

7
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.070
with its cure lying within it.

8
00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:22.170
So can someone do all the right religious
things and still be facing the wrong

9
00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.060
way?

10
00:00:23.110 --> 00:00:27.590
In this mission, you'll meet two Sikh
words for the direction a life can face.

11
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:31.950
Then you'll see how Sikhs practise
remembering God's Name through the day.

12
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.070
Your mission: find out what Sikhs believe
decides which way a person is facing.
